# Architecture Decisions

Create an ADR when a change affects project structure, dependencies, design boundaries, deployment flow, integration strategy, or long-term maintainability.

Use:

```bash
npm run adr:new -- "Decision title"
```

Then complete the generated file in `docs/architecture/decisions/`.

Create or update an ADR for:

- new architectural pattern;
- new dependency with project impact;
- folder restructuring;
- change in animation, styling, data, deploy, or integration strategy;
- decision that has meaningful trade-offs.

Do not create ADRs for tiny implementation details or one-off bug fixes.
